@base=http://localhost:8080
@connId=

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### List connections (sample only)
GET {{base}}/connections

# Note: When Redis is enabled (REDIS_URL set), count is global across workers.
# Response shape: { "count": <number>, "sample": [ { deviceId, appId, connId } ] }

### Push to a specific device (set deviceId)
POST {{base}}/push/device
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceId": "device-001",
  "payload": { "type": "server_msg", "text": "hello device" }
}

# Response:
# - With Redis enabled: { "accepted": true, "online": true|false }
# - Without Redis:     { "delivered": true }
